2. In these Rules, unless the context otherwise requires —
“Controller of Work Passes” means the Controller of Work Passes appointed under section 3 of the Employment of Foreign Manpower Act 1990;
[S 868/2022 wef 31/12/2021]
“foreign employee” has the meaning assigned to it by section 2 of the Employment of Foreign Manpower Act 1990;
[S 868/2022 wef 31/12/2021]
“salary” —
(a)in relation to an employee, means the basic salary and fixed allowances payable each month by the employer to the employee; and
(b)in the case of an employee who is a foreign employee, means the salary of the foreign employee as declared in the application for a work pass for the foreign employee submitted to the Controller of Work Passes appointed under section 3 of the Employment of Foreign Manpower Act 1990;
[S 868/2022 wef 31/12/2021]
“working day” means a day that is not a Saturday, a Sunday or a public holiday.
